{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52012","headline":"过程处士饮率尔成咏 · 王绩","name":"过程处士饮率尔成咏","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"莫道山中泉石好，莫畏人间行路难。\n蜀郡鑪家何必闹，宜城酒店旧来宽。\n盃至定知悬怪晚，饮尽只应速唱看。\n但使百年相续醉，何愁万里客衣单。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王绩","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52012.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52012","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}